<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1444606082"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1511996735"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Say So"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Doja Cat / Nicki Minaj"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Say So"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:20.957"><div begin="00:00.000" end="03:20.957"><p begin="00:00.000" end="00:01.997" itunes:key="L965">Yeah, you know it<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你懂的</span></p><p begin="00:03.588" end="00:06.457" itunes:key="L966">Mmm, this the remix<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这是混音版</span></p><p begin="00:07.235" end="00:08.301" itunes:key="L967">Doja<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">携手蜜桃貓朵佳</span></p><p begin="00:10.311" end="00:14.332" itunes:key="L971">Day to night to morning, keep with me in the moment<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每时每刻都和我在一起 享受当下</span></p><p begin="00:14.342" end="00:18.721" itunes:key="L972">I'd let you had I known it, why don't you say so?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会让你如愿以偿 没错 你为什么不这样说</span></p><p begin="00:18.975" end="00:22.961" itunes:key="L973">Didn't even notice, no punches left to roll with<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">甚至没发现已经进行到这一步</span></p><p begin="00:22.998" end="00:27.321" itunes:key="L974">You got to keep me focused, you want it? Say so (Uh)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你得吸引我的注意力 你很渴望 直说无妨</span></p><p begin="00:27.334" end="00:29.787" itunes:key="L977">Every time I take a break the game be so boring<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每当我暂时隐退一阵子 这行业就显得了无生气</span></p><p begin="00:29.797" end="00:31.910" itunes:key="L978">Pretty like Naomi, Cassie, plus Lauren<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的美丽 堪比Naomi Campbell和Cassie Ventura以及Lauren London</span></p><p begin="00:31.920" end="00:34.116" itunes:key="L979">Spittin' like Weezy, Foxy, plus Lauryn<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">说唱实力 堪比Lil Wayne和Foxy Brown以及Lauryn Hill</span></p><p begin="00:34.126" end="00:36.284" itunes:key="L980">Ball like the Rams, see, now that's Gordon<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">富有程度 堪比洛杉矶公羊队 你看 眼前这位是Gordon Ramsay</span></p><p begin="00:36.291" end="00:38.474" itunes:key="L981">They don't understand the bag talk, I'm foreign<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">他们不明白我说的那些话 我是外国人</span></p><p begin="00:38.484" end="00:40.625" itunes:key="L982">When they think they top the queen they start falling<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当她们以为自己超越了我 她们就已经开始堕落了</span></p><p begin="00:40.635" end="00:42.793" itunes:key="L983">Word to my **** shots, I'm so cheeky<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">臀部整形怎么了 我就是脸皮厚</span></p><p begin="00:42.803" end="00:44.930" itunes:key="L984">Got 'em tryna palm my **** like young Keke<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">男人都想拍拍我的翘臀 就像Keke Palmer一样</span></p><p begin="00:44.944" end="00:47.078" itunes:key="L985">Yes, I'm ghetto, word to Geppetto<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没错 我就是混街头的 撒谎是小狗</span></p><p begin="00:47.088" end="00:49.206" itunes:key="L986">Plus, I'm little, where's my stiletto?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的身材很娇小 我的高跟鞋在哪里</span></p><p begin="00:49.236" end="00:51.345" itunes:key="L987">Tell Mike Jordan send me my Retros<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">告诉麦克·乔丹 把我的复刻球鞋寄给我</span></p><p begin="00:51.355" end="00:53.609" itunes:key="L988">Used to be bi, but now I'm just hetero<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">曾经男的女的我都爱 但现在我是个异性恋</span></p><p begin="00:53.631" end="00:55.976" itunes:key="L989">Ain't talking medicine, but I made him more a fiend<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我说的不是药物什么的 但我确实让他如痴如醉</span></p><p begin="00:55.986" end="00:58.203" itunes:key="L990">Ever since I put the cookie on quarantine<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">自从我断绝了男女之事以后</span></p><p begin="00:58.213" end="01:00.076" itunes:key="L991">He know this thing A1 like a felony<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">他知道我的身材一级棒</span></p><p begin="01:00.086" end="01:02.280" itunes:key="L992">All he gotta do is say the word like a spelling bee<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">他要做的全部就是大胆说出心里话</span></p><p begin="01:02.290" end="01:06.322" itunes:key="L994">Day to night to morning, keep with me in the moment<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每时每刻都和我在一起 享受当下</span></p><p begin="01:06.332" end="01:10.601" itunes:key="L995">I'd let you had I known it, why don't you say so?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会让你如愿以偿 没错 你为什么不这样说</span></p><p begin="01:10.829" end="01:14.900" itunes:key="L996">Didn't even notice, no punches left to roll with<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">甚至没发现已经进行到这一步</span></p><p begin="01:14.906" end="01:19.171" itunes:key="L997">You got to keep me focused, you want it? Say so (Yeah)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你得吸引我的注意力 你很渴望 直说无妨</span></p><p begin="01:19.184" end="01:21.818" itunes:key="L999">Let me check my chest, my breath right quick (Ha)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的心砰砰直跳 呼吸急促</span></p><p begin="01:21.828" end="01:23.946" itunes:key="L1000">He ain't ever seen it in a dress like this (Ah)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">他从没见过这样的打扮</span></p><p begin="01:23.950" end="01:25.795" itunes:key="L1001">He ain't ever even been impressed like this<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">他从来没被这样惊艳过</span></p><p begin="01:25.805" end="01:28.000" itunes:key="L1002">Prolly why I got him quiet on the set like zip<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我怎么就让他震惊得哑口无言</span></p><p begin="01:28.117" end="01:30.293" itunes:key="L1003">Like it, love it, need it, bad<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">肆意妄为 勇敢去爱</span></p><p begin="01:30.330" end="01:32.435" itunes:key="L1004">Take it, own it, steal it, fast<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">把一切据为己有</span></p><p begin="01:32.445" end="01:34.473" itunes:key="L1005">Boy, stop playing, grab my ****<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">男孩 别再嘻嘻哈哈 主动出击</span></p><p begin="01:34.483" end="01:36.830" itunes:key="L1006">Why you actin' like you shy? (Hot)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为何你要这样害羞</span></p><p begin="01:36.840" end="01:38.992" itunes:key="L1007">Shut it, save it, keep it pushin'<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">火辣</span></p><p begin="01:39.002" end="01:41.220" itunes:key="L1008">Why you beating 'round the bush?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为何你总是拐弯抹角</span></p><p begin="01:41.230" end="01:43.581" itunes:key="L1009">Knowin' you want all this woman<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我知道你想要眼前这个女人</span></p><p begin="01:43.091" end="01:45.508" itunes:key="L1010">Never knock it till you try (Yah, yah)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你不试试 怎么能得到呢</span></p><p begin="01:45.524" end="01:47.636" itunes:key="L1011">All of them **** hating, I have you with me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">其他女人都嫉妒我和你在一起</span></p><p begin="01:47.646" end="01:49.772" itunes:key="L1012">All of my **** sayin' you mad committed<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的朋友都说我失去理智</span></p><p begin="01:49.782" end="01:51.929" itunes:key="L1013">Realer than anybody you had and pretty<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我比你的前任们都要真诚 漂亮</span></p><p begin="01:51.971" end="01:54.251" itunes:key="L1014">All of the body-ody, the **** and ****<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你梦寐以求的一切 我全都拥有</span></p><p begin="01:54.261" end="01:58.098" itunes:key="L1017">Day to night to morning, keep with me in the moment<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每时每刻都和我在一起 享受当下</span></p><p begin="01:58.158" end="02:02.493" itunes:key="L1018">I'd let you had I known it, why don't you say so?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会让你如愿以偿 没错 你为什么不这样说</span></p><p begin="02:02.705" end="02:06.786" itunes:key="L1019">Didn't even notice, no punches left to roll with<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">甚至没发现已经进行到这一步</span></p><p begin="02:06.966" end="02:11.187" itunes:key="L1020">You got to keep me focused, you want it? Say so<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你得吸引我的注意力 你很渴望 直说无妨</span></p><p begin="02:11.464" end="02:15.509" itunes:key="L1021">Day to night to morning, keep with me in the moment<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每时每刻都和我在一起 享受当下</span></p><p begin="02:15.519" end="02:19.725" itunes:key="L1022">I'd let you had I known it, why don't you say so?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会让你如愿以偿 没错 你为什么不这样说</span></p><p begin="02:20.056" end="02:24.157" itunes:key="L1023">Didn't even notice, no punches left to roll with<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">甚至没发现已经进行到这一步</span></p><p begin="02:24.164" end="02:28.485" itunes:key="L1024">You got to keep me focused, you want it? Say so<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你得吸引我的注意力 你很渴望 直说无妨</span></p><p begin="02:33.702" end="02:35.423" itunes:key="L1027">(And you know it)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你懂的</span></p><p begin="02:35.742" end="02:37.599" itunes:key="L10834">(Yeah, you know it)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你懂的</span></p><p begin="02:42.247" end="02:44.171" itunes:key="L11165">(And you know it)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你懂的</span></p><p begin="02:44.281" end="02:47.882" itunes:key="L11635">Yeah, you know it<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你懂的</span></p><p begin="02:49.177" end="02:51.996" itunes:key="L1028">You could have said so<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你直说无妨</span></p><p begin="02:53.556" end="02:56.152" itunes:key="L1029">Boy, you should have said so<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你真该直说无妨</span></p><p begin="02:58.502" end="03:00.544" itunes:key="L1030">Say so<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">直说无妨 直说无妨</span></p><p begin="03:00.653" end="03:05.035" itunes:key="L1031">Say so</p><p begin="03:03.525" end="03:05.366" itunes:key="L1033">I got dressed just to sit in the house<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我打扮得漂漂亮亮的 就这样坐在家里</span></p><p begin="03:05.539" end="03:07.562" itunes:key="L1034">People with the least always doing the most<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没什么本事的人总是最喜欢装模作样</span></p><p begin="03:07.678" end="03:09.607" itunes:key="L1035">I count money while he suckin' my toes<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">他在那里舔我的脚趾 我就在那里数钞票</span></p><p begin="03:09.617" end="03:12.093" itunes:key="L1036">Real nasty with them balls, all net, yeah, I'm gross<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">对男人真的有一套 我的财富超越很多人</span></p><p begin="03:12.738" end="03:14.365" itunes:key="L1037">Why you talking 'bout who body fake?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为什么你要谈论谁的身体整形了</span></p><p begin="03:14.375" end="03:16.518" itunes:key="L1038">With all the fillers in your face, you just full of hate<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你自己的脸都动了刀子 你明明就是嫉妒</span></p><p begin="03:16.528" end="03:18.523" itunes:key="L1039">That real **** ain't keep your **** home<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算你的臀部没有整形 也还是没法留住你的男人</span></p><p begin="03:18.533" end="03:20.957" itunes:key="L1040">Now you lookin' silly, that's word to silicone<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在你看起来傻乎乎的 这还得多亏了硅胶整形呢</span></p></div></body></tt